      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORNING DAISY (4) hit the ground running and on speed early but faded out of it to finish fourth (24.41) at this track over 425m. Solid record here at the distance winning six races. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. Can bounce back. WEST TWO AFFAIR (5) was a strong winner (16.92) from box 2 last time, scoring by 2 lengths at Healesville. Will need some luck early after drawing a tricky box here. Has definite claims. EVERGLOW (1) finds it hard to break through. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing second (24.36) at this track. Has a good record here including three wins. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Expected to feature. NOTORIOUS BLAZE (2) will have admirers again after leading then holding on for a placing last time out.",
